(6416798, 952168, 67258, '<td valign="top">Now that''s one unusual, vivid and, to be honest, rather ugly flower!  I have never seen anything like it before and that is always a bonus - I love the way voting on DPC opens us up to new things.  one point, technically, there seems to be some banding in the sky, which you may want to rectify if you ever print this photo.</td>', 'Now that''s one unusual, vivid and, to be honest, rather ugly flower!  I have never seen anything like it before and that is always a bonus - I love the way voting on DPC opens us up to new things.  one point, technically, there seems to be some banding in the sky, which you may want to rectify if you ever print this photo.', '2011-05-18 09:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6416799, 951272, 23484, '<td valign="top">Perfect title for this. Nice job.</td>', 'Perfect title for this. Nice job.', '2011-05-18 09:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6416805, 952115, 67258, '<td valign="top">My Dicentra didn''t survive the very hard frosts and prolonged snow of the winter before last.  Viewing this photo reminds me that I must replace it - it is such an unusual flower, such an ''unlikely'' flower!  I like the way the flowers stand out so well from the uncluttered background.  Only point I would raise is the sharply focussed leaf tip that has crept into the top right of the frame, which does draw my attention somewhat.</td>', 'My Dicentra didn''t survive the very hard frosts and prolonged snow of the winter before last.  Viewing this photo reminds me that I must replace it - it is such an unusual flower, such an ''unlikely'' flower!  I like the way the flowers stand out so well from the uncluttered background.  Only point I would raise is the sharply focussed leaf tip that has crept into the top right of the frame, which does draw my attention somewhat.', '2011-05-18 09:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
