(6417228, 951300, 124190, '<td valign="top">Super! I''m relieved to see a scene which captures a story AND meets the parameters of the challenge.  I tired of looking at closeups of single spring blooms...(including my own!!!)    Wait....hold on......is that my soon to be ex-husband?   What is he doing in what seems to be England?  I didnt think they had double decker buses in Pennsylvania!!!  hahahh lolol   Getting back to your shot....love the angle, emphasis on the pansy flower bed taking up 2/3 of the frame and great juxtaposition against the red buses and red lights....did you wait for that moment or was is just by chance?  Cool shot!</td>', 'Super! I''m relieved to see a scene which captures a story AND meets the parameters of the challenge.  I tired of looking at closeups of single spring blooms...(including my own!!!)    Wait....hold on......is that my soon to be ex-husband?   What is he doing in what seems to be England?  I didnt think they had double decker buses in Pennsylvania!!!  hahahh lolol   Getting back to your shot....love the angle, emphasis on the pansy flower bed taking up 2/3 of the frame and great juxtaposition against the red buses and red lights....did you wait for that moment or was is just by chance?  Cool shot!', '2011-05-18 13:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
