(6417233, 952082, 124190, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  Your choice to concentrate on the flowers and leave out the faces works well for the challenge. Beautiful colors...and composition....I feel like she has yet to marry.....walking down the aisle!  Lucky bride....ranunculus.....beeeeeeautious!!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'Wonderful!  Your choice to concentrate on the flowers and leave out the faces works well for the challenge. Beautiful colors...and composition....I feel like she has yet to marry.....walking down the aisle!  Lucky bride....ranunculus.....beeeeeeautious!!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2011-05-18 14:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
