(6417266, 952033, 58634, '<td valign="top">Incredible colors and great focus. There''s something about the composition that bothers me but I can''t put my finger on it. If I figure it out, I will come back.</td>', 'Incredible colors and great focus. There''s something about the composition that bothers me but I can''t put my finger on it. If I figure it out, I will come back.', '2011-05-18 14:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
