(6417335, 951915, 11854, '<td valign="top">Back to comment... Love the back lighting. Brave to go b&amp;w in a flower challenge, competing with so much color. But, it works! Bravo! 8</td>', 'Back to comment... Love the back lighting. Brave to go b&w in a flower challenge, competing with so much color. But, it works! Bravo! 8', '2011-05-18 16:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
