(6417785, 951877, 124815, '<td valign="top">One of the perennial miracles. It bothers me that it''s not straighten and I would have cut the entire dark area above the violet road. 8</td>', 'One of the perennial miracles. It bothers me that it''s not straighten and I would have cut the entire dark area above the violet road. 8', '2011-05-18 22:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
