(6417787, 951858, 132996, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. I love the vintage feel to this photo! :)</td>', 'Gorgeous. I love the vintage feel to this photo! :)', '2011-05-18 22:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417791, 952023, 124815, '<td valign="top">If this is not Ammie I cancel my tickets to So. Africa! Just kidding.<br/>There is this sweetness of color, you can almost smell the dry flowers. Am wondering what''s like in a bad day. Or if one turns right or left.</td>', 'If this is not Ammie I cancel my tickets to So. Africa! Just kidding.There is this sweetness of color, you can almost smell the dry flowers. Am wondering what''s like in a bad day. Or if one turns right or left.', '2011-05-18 22:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417795, 951692, 124815, '<td valign="top">A lot of work in this garden. Reminds me of ... the name slips now, in Holland, of course. If this is correct, could you tell me its name? <br/>I particularly like the poet in the background, oblivious to the beauty!</td>', 'A lot of work in this garden. Reminds me of ... the name slips now, in Holland, of course. If this is correct, could you tell me its name? I particularly like the poet in the background, oblivious to the beauty!', '2011-05-18 22:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417799, 952024, 124815, '<td valign="top">Now, where did you find these beauties? Certainly not in a field? It''s almost like a Flemish still life depicting concept such as worldly vanity or temperance or the fleeting nature of earthly pleasures.</td>', 'Now, where did you find these beauties? Certainly not in a field? It''s almost like a Flemish still life depicting concept such as worldly vanity or temperance or the fleeting nature of earthly pleasures.', '2011-05-18 22:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417806, 951064, 98339, '<td valign="top">I am not even sure that this is a flower at all....</td>', 'I am not even sure that this is a flower at all....', '2011-05-18 22:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417807, 951150, 98339, '<td valign="top">IMO your BG is distracting...if you had dropped your f-stop below 5 you would get that lovely ooey gooey background</td>', 'IMO your BG is distracting...if you had dropped your f-stop below 5 you would get that lovely ooey gooey background', '2011-05-18 22:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417808, 951890, 124815, '<td valign="top">Not only wild, but all posing for you! Very cheerful. 7</td>', 'Not only wild, but all posing for you! Very cheerful. 7', '2011-05-18 22:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417810, 951973, 124815, '<td valign="top">This shot has a great, great potential - a lovely idea but not taken IMHO too far. I do not like the place of the cropping of the flower, the light is too big, too much like the star of the Magi - perhaps a hint of light, a small dot would have been enough. But a truly appreciate the approach.</td>', 'This shot has a great, great potential - a lovely idea but not taken IMHO too far. I do not like the place of the cropping of the flower, the light is too big, too much like the star of the Magi - perhaps a hint of light, a small dot would have been enough. But a truly appreciate the approach.', '2011-05-18 22:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417812, 952111, 124815, '<td valign="top">Wow, God forbid! Imagine a field of it!</td>', 'Wow, God forbid! Imagine a field of it!', '2011-05-18 22:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417813, 952042, 98339, '<td valign="top">it can really be tricky getting great sharp pictures of flowers and a wonderful BG like you have...it seems that there is alway such a narrow field of focus when using these f-stops...IMO (which does not count for much) I would have preferred this to have the focus on the top leading me down to the softer areas of focus, leading my eye out of the photo...rather than on the bottom one and the next one up on the right side, then I stop...I''m not lead out of the picture (if you get what I mean...probably not)</td>', 'it can really be tricky getting great sharp pictures of flowers and a wonderful BG like you have...it seems that there is alway such a narrow field of focus when using these f-stops...IMO (which does not count for much) I would have preferred this to have the focus on the top leading me down to the softer areas of focus, leading my eye out of the photo...rather than on the bottom one and the next one up on the right side, then I stop...I''m not lead out of the picture (if you get what I mean...probably not)', '2011-05-18 22:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417815, 951626, 98339, '<td valign="top">Focus is very soft on this IMO</td>', 'Focus is very soft on this IMO', '2011-05-18 22:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417817, 952110, 124815, '<td valign="top">Oh boy, I had to search the meaning of it:<br/>"There are about 19 different species of bumblebee (and six species of cuckoo bumblebees) found in the UK, 66 in Europe and around 250 in the world."<br/>I thought that we were dealing with a carnivore plant.<br/>Very nice ruffle and ripple of the image, independently of the Field of Flowers ...</td>', 'Oh boy, I had to search the meaning of it:"There are about 19 different species of bumblebee (and six species of cuckoo bumblebees) found in the UK, 66 in Europe and around 250 in the world."I thought that we were dealing with a carnivore plant.Very nice ruffle and ripple of the image, independently of the Field of Flowers ...', '2011-05-18 22:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417818, 951723, 124815, '<td valign="top">Very lovely title for the image. A bit too commercial, but certainly so well done.</td>', 'Very lovely title for the image. A bit too commercial, but certainly so well done.', '2011-05-18 22:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417820, 951064, 124815, '<td valign="top">It surely is very, very lovely, dark and deep but I long to get a better glimpse of it to put it in my mind''s flower drawer! Otherwise it might just get the meaning lost in a thousand of other thoughts.</td>', 'It surely is very, very lovely, dark and deep but I long to get a better glimpse of it to put it in my mind''s flower drawer! Otherwise it might just get the meaning lost in a thousand of other thoughts.', '2011-05-18 22:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417821, 951234, 124815, '<td valign="top">Again, the title enhances the image that would otherwise just get sorted in a great greeting cards genre.</td>', 'Again, the title enhances the image that would otherwise just get sorted in a great greeting cards genre.', '2011-05-18 22:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417824, 951724, 124815, '<td valign="top">Good approach with a powerful and a bit cruel image. I am missing just a touch of more detail at the edge of the beaten, warrior flower.</td>', 'Good approach with a powerful and a bit cruel image. I am missing just a touch of more detail at the edge of the beaten, warrior flower.', '2011-05-18 22:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417826, 952022, 124815, '<td valign="top">fabulous lighting.</td>', 'fabulous lighting.', '2011-05-18 22:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417828, 951915, 124815, '<td valign="top">A truly good studio picture</td>', 'A truly good studio picture', '2011-05-18 22:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417830, 951390, 124815, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color palette, composition and title</td>', 'Beautiful color palette, composition and title', '2011-05-18 22:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417834, 952079, 98339, '<td valign="top">I think these are Bleeding Hearts...not sure I like this angle, your colors although are outstanding</td>', 'I think these are Bleeding Hearts...not sure I like this angle, your colors although are outstanding', '2011-05-18 22:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417836, 951954, 98339, '<td valign="top">I have decided it is very, very hard to get red right in PP...on my monitor this looks over saturated...</td>', 'I have decided it is very, very hard to get red right in PP...on my monitor this looks over saturated...', '2011-05-18 22:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
