(6417874, 951463, 98339, '<td valign="top">this is really pretty, you have really good detail...to my eye if you had turned the flower just a bit - to say the 2 o''clock position (lower right corner) your center of the flower would have really lead me through the picture, making my eye travel fluidly through the picture (not sure if that makes sense or not...)</td>', 'this is really pretty, you have really good detail...to my eye if you had turned the flower just a bit - to say the 2 o''clock position (lower right corner) your center of the flower would have really lead me through the picture, making my eye travel fluidly through the picture (not sure if that makes sense or not...)', '2011-05-18 23:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6417875, 952100, 124815, '<td valign="top">Magnificent elegance, story, poise, tonality. It does surpass by far a beautiful flower shot. And to think that it''s basic editing! Could one find an entire field of these? I wish.</td>', 'Magnificent elegance, story, poise, tonality. It does surpass by far a beautiful flower shot. And to think that it''s basic editing! Could one find an entire field of these? I wish.', '2011-05-18 23:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
