(6418450, 951885, 130900, '<td valign="top">Great detail. Love the comp and DoF.</td>', 'Great detail. Love the comp and DoF.', '2011-05-19 13:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6418455, 951784, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely model &amp; some beautiful light. I don''t see it as a flower shot, though, sorry. Not even a flower in a field.</td>', 'This is a lovely model & some beautiful light. I don''t see it as a flower shot, though, sorry. Not even a flower in a field.', '2011-05-19 14:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6418472, 951275, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture, great sense of "place". I can feel that I am standing there looking across the field and enjoying the hills and the interesting building in the background, and the splashes of color provided by the poppies.  The only drawback, to my eyes, is that the barley is over sharpened, and many of the flowers out of focus. But overall, a fun picture to explore.</td>', 'Lovely capture, great sense of "place". I can feel that I am standing there looking across the field and enjoying the hills and the interesting building in the background, and the splashes of color provided by the poppies.  The only drawback, to my eyes, is that the barley is over sharpened, and many of the flowers out of focus. But overall, a fun picture to explore.', '2011-05-19 14:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6418477, 952159, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones and an interesting choice of B&amp;W. The only drawback is that is lacks any sense of "place".  It could just as easily have been taken indoors as outdoors.  ~ I''m not saying that it was taken indoors, just that for this challenge I appreciate and prefer those images that convey the sense of a garden or field more than those that do not.</td>', 'Lovely tones and an interesting choice of B&W. The only drawback is that is lacks any sense of "place".  It could just as easily have been taken indoors as outdoors.  ~ I''m not saying that it was taken indoors, just that for this challenge I appreciate and prefer those images that convey the sense of a garden or field more than those that do not.', '2011-05-19 14:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6418481, 951840, 104230, '<td valign="top">Great sense of place (and time of year!)  I''m finding the composition a bit too centered for my taste, but I love the back lighting of the grass seeds and most of the poppies.</td>', 'Great sense of place (and time of year!)  I''m finding the composition a bit too centered for my taste, but I love the back lighting of the grass seeds and most of the poppies.', '2011-05-19 15:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6418484, 951692, 104230, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, and place.  I''m guessing these are flower beds in a park. To my eyes this is over sharpened, and it is kind of hard to make out what the purple flowers are (pansies I think). I like the inclusion of the person walking, hands behind his back, taken in England maybe?</td>', 'Interesting image, and place.  I''m guessing these are flower beds in a park. To my eyes this is over sharpened, and it is kind of hard to make out what the purple flowers are (pansies I think). I like the inclusion of the person walking, hands behind his back, taken in England maybe?', '2011-05-19 15:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6418496, 951784, 91379, '<td valign="top">One of the best images in this competition. It has flowers and it has life. 10 from me.</td>', 'One of the best images in this competition. It has flowers and it has life. 10 from me.', '2011-05-19 15:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6418497, 952119, 91379, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful! I can feel the sensibility of this flower in your immage. I gave you a 10.</td>', 'Very beautiful! I can feel the sensibility of this flower in your immage. I gave you a 10.', '2011-05-19 15:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
