(6418606, 952010, 125975, '<td valign="top">I laughed out loud at this humorous interpretation of the challenge.  Bravo.</td>', 'I laughed out loud at this humorous interpretation of the challenge.  Bravo.', '2011-05-19 18:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6418608, 952169, 125975, '<td valign="top">I adore plum blossoms and normally love this kind of shot, but it''s too blurry for my old eyes.  I can''t tell where the focus is.</td>', 'I adore plum blossoms and normally love this kind of shot, but it''s too blurry for my old eyes.  I can''t tell where the focus is.', '2011-05-19 18:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6418609, 952130, 125389, '<td valign="top">I have given your photo a 10.  What I have learned from this challenge is that fields of flowers rarely photograph well.  Your picture shows me what I have been doing wrong...focus on one flower and bokah the rest.  I appreciate the lesson I have learned from your entry.  I hope you win.</td>', 'I have given your photo a 10.  What I have learned from this challenge is that fields of flowers rarely photograph well.  Your picture shows me what I have been doing wrong...focus on one flower and bokah the rest.  I appreciate the lesson I have learned from your entry.  I hope you win.', '2011-05-19 18:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6418610, 951820, 125389, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo....I gave it a 9.</td>', 'Lovely photo....I gave it a 9.', '2011-05-19 18:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6418612, 951392, 125975, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure where I should be looking, as there doesn''t seem to be a clear focal point. The only crispness I see is the stem with the little hairs on the stem in the left hand side of the picture.<br/>You have some nice bokeh showing up, however.</td>', 'I''m not sure where I should be looking, as there doesn''t seem to be a clear focal point. The only crispness I see is the stem with the little hairs on the stem in the left hand side of the picture.You have some nice bokeh showing up, however.', '2011-05-19 18:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6418613, 952149, 125975, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous plum blossom and buds!  I would have liked this even more without the white statue on the left.</td>', 'Gorgeous plum blossom and buds!  I would have liked this even more without the white statue on the left.', '2011-05-19 18:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6418616, 951418, 125975, '<td valign="top">Great leading line and composition here, but I would like to see the bleeding heart flowers more in focus and sharper.</td>', 'Great leading line and composition here, but I would like to see the bleeding heart flowers more in focus and sharper.', '2011-05-19 18:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6418617, 952115, 125975, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft bokeh effect here, but I would prefer a little more sharpness on the flowers.</td>', 'Lovely soft bokeh effect here, but I would prefer a little more sharpness on the flowers.', '2011-05-19 18:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6418621, 951885, 125975, '<td valign="top">Monet?  I do so love this shot with the lovely bokeh and the beautiful blue and yellow colors.</td>', 'Monet?  I do so love this shot with the lovely bokeh and the beautiful blue and yellow colors.', '2011-05-19 18:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6418623, 951278, 125975, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for pink tulips.  Gorgeousness!</td>', 'I''m a sucker for pink tulips.  Gorgeousness!', '2011-05-19 18:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6418633, 952152, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity in this photograph.</td>', 'I like the simplicity in this photograph.', '2011-05-19 19:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6418634, 951394, 58634, '<td valign="top">Most of the images in this challenge seem to be bright and colorful, yet I feel like this one has a matte feel to it. I think it''s different and adds a lot to the picture.</td>', 'Most of the images in this challenge seem to be bright and colorful, yet I feel like this one has a matte feel to it. I think it''s different and adds a lot to the picture.', '2011-05-19 19:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6418636, 952100, 58634, '<td valign="top">How beautiful! I love the clarity and I''m in love with your use of DOF. Very different and unique.</td>', 'How beautiful! I love the clarity and I''m in love with your use of DOF. Very different and unique.', '2011-05-19 19:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6418639, 951851, 58634, '<td valign="top">I really like the violet and blues.</td>', 'I really like the violet and blues.', '2011-05-19 19:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
