(6418641, 951465, 124815, '<td valign="top">It surely is not red, even in B&amp;W, but seems to be well protected by its guard of swords. I give it a well deserved 8.</td>', 'It surely is not red, even in B&W, but seems to be well protected by its guard of swords. I give it a well deserved 8.', '2011-05-19 19:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
