(6418786, 951784, 58634, '<td valign="top">I think it would''ve been a better challenge fit for you to switch your entries of the 2 current challenges. The reasoning for this is because in this image, the sun lighting is more profound and fits the sunrise/sunset: Look the other way, better; whilst in your entry for that challenge,  the flowers were more accentuated.<br/> <br/>With that put aside, I really like this image and think you used the "soft" feature much better. <br/> <br/>Hope you find that helpful.</td>', 'I think it would''ve been a better challenge fit for you to switch your entries of the 2 current challenges. The reasoning for this is because in this image, the sun lighting is more profound and fits the sunrise/sunset: Look the other way, better; whilst in your entry for that challenge,  the flowers were more accentuated. With that put aside, I really like this image and think you used the "soft" feature much better.  Hope you find that helpful.', '2011-05-19 22:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
