(6420461, 952140, 98339, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t care for the really blown B&amp;W pictures (I''m not even sure what this process is even called...)...this just doesn''t draw me in like some of the other colored pictures that are richly toned in this challenge...I mean NO offense...it''s JMO...</td>', 'I personally don''t care for the really blown B&W pictures (I''m not even sure what this process is even called...)...this just doesn''t draw me in like some of the other colored pictures that are richly toned in this challenge...I mean NO offense...it''s JMO...', '2011-05-21 12:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6420462, 952043, 98339, '<td valign="top">in proportion to the rest of the picture...your one dandelion that is in focus is really out of proportion IMO...if you had cropped out the top half of this it would really put my focus where it need to be on the flowers</td>', 'in proportion to the rest of the picture...your one dandelion that is in focus is really out of proportion IMO...if you had cropped out the top half of this it would really put my focus where it need to be on the flowers', '2011-05-21 12:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
