(6420475, 951784, 98339, '<td valign="top">in this challenge I would have preferred to have seen MORE flowers less girl...that being said...I do like the candid portrait of this...but that''s not where I want my focus on in this challenge</td>', 'in this challenge I would have preferred to have seen MORE flowers less girl...that being said...I do like the candid portrait of this...but that''s not where I want my focus on in this challenge', '2011-05-21 12:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
