(6420478, 951457, 98339, '<td valign="top">2 things, your clarity is very soft...the stem of the flower is super sharp...but not the "flower" itself...red is one of the hardest colors to get right in PP...this challenge has really confirmed that I''m NOT going to target things that are red...</td>', '2 things, your clarity is very soft...the stem of the flower is super sharp...but not the "flower" itself...red is one of the hardest colors to get right in PP...this challenge has really confirmed that I''m NOT going to target things that are red...', '2011-05-21 12:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6420479, 951850, 98339, '<td valign="top">I wish you had gotten right down in the face of the beautiful trillium (haven''t seen one in years!!) if you had used a f-stop of 5 or lower you could have gotten that wonderful ooey gooey background...in this the BG is fighting for my attention</td>', 'I wish you had gotten right down in the face of the beautiful trillium (haven''t seen one in years!!) if you had used a f-stop of 5 or lower you could have gotten that wonderful ooey gooey background...in this the BG is fighting for my attention', '2011-05-21 12:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6420480, 952094, 117717, '<td valign="top">I''m just not seeing a flower in all its "natural glory".</td>', 'I''m just not seeing a flower in all its "natural glory".', '2011-05-21 12:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6420481, 951506, 98339, '<td valign="top">to bad the tip of your flower is cropped/framed off this...to me this seems flat in colors...it''s lacking the richness that I think it could have</td>', 'to bad the tip of your flower is cropped/framed off this...to me this seems flat in colors...it''s lacking the richness that I think it could have', '2011-05-21 12:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
