(6420497, 951769, 98339, '<td valign="top">this is going to sound technical/trite, but if you had composed this with the stem (base stem) going from one corner to the other it would have moved your flower to the rule of thirds point...it also would have taken my eye (made it flow) through the photo vs across the photo...to me that is a more compelling composition...I mean NO offense</td>', 'this is going to sound technical/trite, but if you had composed this with the stem (base stem) going from one corner to the other it would have moved your flower to the rule of thirds point...it also would have taken my eye (made it flow) through the photo vs across the photo...to me that is a more compelling composition...I mean NO offense', '2011-05-21 12:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6420498, 952169, 98339, '<td valign="top">clarity...this is way to soft on the focusing</td>', 'clarity...this is way to soft on the focusing', '2011-05-21 12:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
