(6420654, 951881, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of motion you''ve got going on in this image. <br/>However, I think the big yellow flower that''s blurred out right in the middle is distracting.</td>', 'I like the sense of motion you''ve got going on in this image. However, I think the big yellow flower that''s blurred out right in the middle is distracting.', '2011-05-21 15:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
