(6421214, 951107, 65234, '<td valign="top">For a spider, s/he''s pretty cute ;-)  Well composed and great job on the focus.</td>', 'For a spider, s/he''s pretty cute ;-)  Well composed and great job on the focus.', '2011-05-22 11:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421220, 951508, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and focus on the flower and the bugs.  Very pretty patterns on that iris; good choice for a flower challenge!  I know from my own garden that flowers host an infinite variety of bugs, so I''m getting a kick out of finding more and more in this image the longer I look at it ;-)</td>', 'Great DOF and focus on the flower and the bugs.  Very pretty patterns on that iris; good choice for a flower challenge!  I know from my own garden that flowers host an infinite variety of bugs, so I''m getting a kick out of finding more and more in this image the longer I look at it ;-)', '2011-05-22 11:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421222, 952047, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and composition.  I love the soft fuzziness and gentle light.  Liking this one more the longer I look at it!</td>', 'Beautiful colors and composition.  I love the soft fuzziness and gentle light.  Liking this one more the longer I look at it!', '2011-05-22 11:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421224, 952081, 65234, '<td valign="top">What a fun flower!</td>', 'What a fun flower!', '2011-05-22 11:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421226, 951598, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the cool tones; so soothing to look at.</td>', 'Love the cool tones; so soothing to look at.', '2011-05-22 11:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421228, 952089, 65234, '<td valign="top">Excellent isolation of the one flower and repetitive patterns in the background.  Showing off the individual and the group at the same time.</td>', 'Excellent isolation of the one flower and repetitive patterns in the background.  Showing off the individual and the group at the same time.', '2011-05-22 11:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421233, 952067, 65234, '<td valign="top">I love dogwoods!  The open, airy shape of the trees, the way the blooms are spread out when the tree is in the shade, the soft beauty of the flowers.  Not ever gaudy.  Finding them on a spring walk in the woods is always such a delight.  I think you captured that feeling here :-)</td>', 'I love dogwoods!  The open, airy shape of the trees, the way the blooms are spread out when the tree is in the shade, the soft beauty of the flowers.  Not ever gaudy.  Finding them on a spring walk in the woods is always such a delight.  I think you captured that feeling here :-)', '2011-05-22 11:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421234, 952162, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect!</td>', 'Very cool effect!', '2011-05-22 11:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421235, 951308, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the soft, creamy feel to the flower.</td>', 'Love the soft, creamy feel to the flower.', '2011-05-22 12:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421238, 951943, 65234, '<td valign="top">Fabulous structure to this flower!  Is that ironweed?  Looks like it, but could be a cornflower.  I tend to mix them up ;-)</td>', 'Fabulous structure to this flower!  Is that ironweed?  Looks like it, but could be a cornflower.  I tend to mix them up ;-)', '2011-05-22 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421244, 951290, 65234, '<td valign="top">Funny, I don''t call these Bluebells.  We have Virginia Bluebells here which are an entirely different plant.  I always call these Wood Hyacinths (I have some in my garden) but I''ve seen several called Bluebells in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Which says nothing about your image ;-)  So ... nicely composed to show off the individual flowers on the stalk and hint at more in the field behind the flower, nice colors and gentle light.</td>', 'Funny, I don''t call these Bluebells.  We have Virginia Bluebells here which are an entirely different plant.  I always call these Wood Hyacinths (I have some in my garden) but I''ve seen several called Bluebells in this challenge. Which says nothing about your image ;-)  So ... nicely composed to show off the individual flowers on the stalk and hint at more in the field behind the flower, nice colors and gentle light.', '2011-05-22 12:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421245, 951581, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  It''s not easy to find the right angle to show off a group of flowers without it feeling too busy.  Like the light, too.</td>', 'Nicely done!  It''s not easy to find the right angle to show off a group of flowers without it feeling too busy.  Like the light, too.', '2011-05-22 12:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
