(6421323, 951398, 98022, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective. Lighting is a little harsh, but if the flower were in better focus the backlighting would have helped expose some good details.</td>', 'Cool perspective. Lighting is a little harsh, but if the flower were in better focus the backlighting would have helped expose some good details.', '2011-05-22 12:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421327, 951940, 47470, '<td valign="top">You have two subjects in this photo, which isn''t necessarily a bad thing, but they don''t go together very well since they aren''t interacting with one another.  The one on the right is even cut off.  The reds and magentas are blown out (as is the white sky) and the background is too busy, so it distracts from the flowers.<br/> <br/>There are a lot of things you could have done different to fix those things.  You could have put a poster board or a sheet behind the flowers to give them a plain background, or you could have changed the angle of the camera to remove the sky and use the bush as a background, or you could have used a longer lens with a shallow depth of field to completely blur the background into oblivion.  I think the image would have also worked better with just one subject, probably the white flower since you refer to it in the title.</td>', 'You have two subjects in this photo, which isn''t necessarily a bad thing, but they don''t go together very well since they aren''t interacting with one another.  The one on the right is even cut off.  The reds and magentas are blown out (as is the white sky) and the background is too busy, so it distracts from the flowers. There are a lot of things you could have done different to fix those things.  You could have put a poster board or a sheet behind the flowers to give them a plain background, or you could have changed the angle of the camera to remove the sky and use the bush as a background, or you could have used a longer lens with a shallow depth of field to completely blur the background into oblivion.  I think the image would have also worked better with just one subject, probably the white flower since you refer to it in the title.', '2011-05-22 12:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421339, 951598, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the blue-greens in the background.  Nice change from the normal yellow-greens.  The blue-greens also seem more whimsical to me, more like the dream you refer to in your title : )</td>', 'I love the blue-greens in the background.  Nice change from the normal yellow-greens.  The blue-greens also seem more whimsical to me, more like the dream you refer to in your title : )', '2011-05-22 13:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421345, 951886, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love how the light focuses on the flowers.  Did you do that through post-processing or did you find the scene like that?  Either way, it reminds me of the style of painting popular in France in the early 1900s.</td>', 'I love how the light focuses on the flowers.  Did you do that through post-processing or did you find the scene like that?  Either way, it reminds me of the style of painting popular in France in the early 1900s.', '2011-05-22 13:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421348, 952095, 47470, '<td valign="top">That border--yikes!  I bet you''re getting a lot of comments on it : )  It''s much too heavy, dark, brooding, urban, etc to go with that picture!</td>', 'That border--yikes!  I bet you''re getting a lot of comments on it : )  It''s much too heavy, dark, brooding, urban, etc to go with that picture!', '2011-05-22 13:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421350, 951733, 113156, '<td valign="top">Lovely texture, very good B&amp;W, nice that you didn''t go over the top with the droplets.</td>', 'Lovely texture, very good B&W, nice that you didn''t go over the top with the droplets.', '2011-05-22 13:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421352, 951707, 113156, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea, very minimalistic in feel.</td>', 'Brilliant idea, very minimalistic in feel.', '2011-05-22 13:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421353, 951107, 47470, '<td valign="top">Spiders and bugs don''t usually scare me, but that guy looks pretty terrifying!</td>', 'Spiders and bugs don''t usually scare me, but that guy looks pretty terrifying!', '2011-05-22 13:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421370, 951308, 98022, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting to bring out the texture of the lilly and good DOF. But the focus here seems to be too much on the insect, which is too small and dark to show much detail on its own.</td>', 'Very nice lighting to bring out the texture of the lilly and good DOF. But the focus here seems to be too much on the insect, which is too small and dark to show much detail on its own.', '2011-05-22 13:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421376, 951969, 117474, '<td valign="top">nice and smooth. Nice contrast in colours between the flower and the fly. I''m not voting in this challenge, but I''d give this a 6 or 7 I''d say. Good contrast. Very outdoor feel. Focus is on the flower and bee without either taking away from the other. <br/> <br/>Only slight criticism is that there appears to be a lot of imperfections on the flower''s petals. It''d be nice were this advanced editing to take them away. There''s probably nothing you could do in basic. So it''s a criticism that can''t be helped with the rules... how useless! :)</td>', 'nice and smooth. Nice contrast in colours between the flower and the fly. I''m not voting in this challenge, but I''d give this a 6 or 7 I''d say. Good contrast. Very outdoor feel. Focus is on the flower and bee without either taking away from the other.  Only slight criticism is that there appears to be a lot of imperfections on the flower''s petals. It''d be nice were this advanced editing to take them away. There''s probably nothing you could do in basic. So it''s a criticism that can''t be helped with the rules... how useless! :)', '2011-05-22 13:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421429, 951598, 98339, '<td valign="top">IMO this could use one more pass with a noise filter...but I do love the background alot...good detail in the one flower</td>', 'IMO this could use one more pass with a noise filter...but I do love the background alot...good detail in the one flower', '2011-05-22 15:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
