(6421542, 951390, 120058, '<td valign="top">I know how annoying it is when people score pictures low without commenting, so here is my reason for giving this a 3: <br/> <br/>I really like this flower, the colours seems to be lovely and I bet it is gorgeous. The angle the ohoto is taken from doesn''t really show how pretty this flower is though. <br/> <br/>It''s a bit out of focus and it''s way too much going on in the background.</td>', 'I know how annoying it is when people score pictures low without commenting, so here is my reason for giving this a 3:  I really like this flower, the colours seems to be lovely and I bet it is gorgeous. The angle the ohoto is taken from doesn''t really show how pretty this flower is though.  It''s a bit out of focus and it''s way too much going on in the background.', '2011-05-22 18:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
