(6421626, 952095, 97225, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo. I''m not keen on the border(and I''m sure you''ll hear that sentiment repeated) but I am scoring you on the image.</td>', 'Fantastic photo. I''m not keen on the border(and I''m sure you''ll hear that sentiment repeated) but I am scoring you on the image.', '2011-05-22 20:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
