(6421757, 952031, 33361, '<td valign="top">LOVE!</td>', 'LOVE!', '2011-05-22 23:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421758, 952045, 33361, '<td valign="top">Nice! Love the spiky plants with that pretty tulip!</td>', 'Nice! Love the spiky plants with that pretty tulip!', '2011-05-22 23:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421759, 951508, 33361, '<td valign="top">Don''t care for the lighting.</td>', 'Don''t care for the lighting.', '2011-05-22 23:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421790, 951840, 124256, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  The sun shining through the petals is nice, but even better is the sun shining through the leaves all over the place.  Just wish the dark leaf angling up to the right at the top right of center wasn''t there.</td>', 'Great shot!  The sun shining through the petals is nice, but even better is the sun shining through the leaves all over the place.  Just wish the dark leaf angling up to the right at the top right of center wasn''t there.', '2011-05-22 23:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421792, 951465, 124256, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  Was this a 1s+ exposure?  I love the streaky oof areas that suggest motion with the poppy sharply the focal point.  Well done!</td>', 'I love this shot.  Was this a 1s+ exposure?  I love the streaky oof areas that suggest motion with the poppy sharply the focal point.  Well done!', '2011-05-22 23:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421794, 951272, 124256, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of dof.  I whole-heartedly agree with your title''s assessment.  Great shot!</td>', 'Very effective use of dof.  I whole-heartedly agree with your title''s assessment.  Great shot!', '2011-05-22 23:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421797, 952033, 124256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  In contrast to many other shots in the challenge, I really like the clean, flawless background, it really helps this shot.</td>', 'Beautiful.  In contrast to many other shots in the challenge, I really like the clean, flawless background, it really helps this shot.', '2011-05-22 23:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421798, 952130, 124256, '<td valign="top">Ah, well done!  I love the way the background steps back to provide a perfect backdrop for the subject that really pops!  Just great!</td>', 'Ah, well done!  I love the way the background steps back to provide a perfect backdrop for the subject that really pops!  Just great!', '2011-05-22 23:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421800, 952130, 117717, '<td valign="top">DOF is perfect!</td>', 'DOF is perfect!', '2011-05-22 23:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421801, 952148, 117717, '<td valign="top">The lighting really enhances the delicate petals</td>', 'The lighting really enhances the delicate petals', '2011-05-22 23:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421805, 952161, 124256, '<td valign="top">Often it seems like the shallow dof closeups leave a of the subject oof unintentionally.  In this case it not only seems deliberate, but really makes for a great shot!  I love how the subject''s "private parts" flatten losing depth, falling to the background while the petal''s edge, replete with dew drop, pops irresistibly drawing the eye.</td>', 'Often it seems like the shallow dof closeups leave a of the subject oof unintentionally.  In this case it not only seems deliberate, but really makes for a great shot!  I love how the subject''s "private parts" flatten losing depth, falling to the background while the petal''s edge, replete with dew drop, pops irresistibly drawing the eye.', '2011-05-22 23:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421807, 951959, 124256, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  Well composed.  I especially like the dark background on the left.</td>', 'Lovely shot.  Well composed.  I especially like the dark background on the left.', '2011-05-22 23:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421809, 952173, 124256, '<td valign="top">The title helps.  I love the way this looks like an egg.</td>', 'The title helps.  I love the way this looks like an egg.', '2011-05-23 00:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421811, 951581, 124256, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, I like the way this shot comes together.  I wish the dof was a bit deeper.</td>', 'Nice composition, I like the way this shot comes together.  I wish the dof was a bit deeper.', '2011-05-23 00:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421812, 951881, 124256, '<td valign="top">Good title.  I really like that flowers in very different stages are all tightly grouped.  Nice capture!</td>', 'Good title.  I really like that flowers in very different stages are all tightly grouped.  Nice capture!', '2011-05-23 00:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421820, 951559, 117717, '<td valign="top">Striking composition, but would prefer it if the flowers were sharper for this challenge.</td>', 'Striking composition, but would prefer it if the flowers were sharper for this challenge.', '2011-05-23 00:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421822, 951598, 117717, '<td valign="top">Good lighting &amp;nice detail in the petals</td>', 'Good lighting &nice detail in the petals', '2011-05-23 00:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422134, 952127, 91379, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, good contrast, good DOF, a little bit too sharpen on the leaf. The composition is unusual, you "read" this picture from right to left (the reverse of the natural way).</td>', 'Nice subject, good contrast, good DOF, a little bit too sharpen on the leaf. The composition is unusual, you "read" this picture from right to left (the reverse of the natural way).', '2011-05-23 08:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422137, 951840, 91379, '<td valign="top">Nice backlight and composition. 8.</td>', 'Nice backlight and composition. 8.', '2011-05-23 08:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422138, 951463, 91379, '<td valign="top">Very soft and gentle this image. Bravo !</td>', 'Very soft and gentle this image. Bravo !', '2011-05-23 08:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422139, 952165, 91379, '<td valign="top">The color, the focus are perfect, although I would have preferred a little more space on the left, or even the flower positioned on the right. I gave an 8.</td>', 'The color, the focus are perfect, although I would have preferred a little more space on the left, or even the flower positioned on the right. I gave an 8.', '2011-05-23 08:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422141, 951468, 91379, '<td valign="top">Wonderful contrast of colors, very good focus and composition</td>', 'Wonderful contrast of colors, very good focus and composition', '2011-05-23 08:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422143, 951236, 91379, '<td valign="top">I like the 2 grounds of this photo: first with the flower, second with the ferns. Nice composition and colors, gives me the impression of being in the jungle. Bravo.</td>', 'I like the 2 grounds of this photo: first with the flower, second with the ferns. Nice composition and colors, gives me the impression of being in the jungle. Bravo.', '2011-05-23 08:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422144, 952098, 91379, '<td valign="top">Good focus and DOF.</td>', 'Good focus and DOF.', '2011-05-23 08:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422145, 951977, 91379, '<td valign="top">Very soft, good focus.</td>', 'Very soft, good focus.', '2011-05-23 08:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422146, 951418, 91379, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, just a little more sharpen</td>', 'Nice DOF, just a little more sharpen', '2011-05-23 08:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422147, 951882, 91379, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, good DOF, the sun lighted spot is stealing the attention on the flower.</td>', 'Nice focus, good DOF, the sun lighted spot is stealing the attention on the flower.', '2011-05-23 08:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422148, 952130, 91379, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and composition. Looks like a painted one.</td>', 'Nice DOF and composition. Looks like a painted one.', '2011-05-23 08:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422149, 952149, 91379, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, disturbing statue.</td>', 'Nice focus, disturbing statue.', '2011-05-23 08:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422150, 951435, 91379, '<td valign="top">nice focus and composition</td>', 'nice focus and composition', '2011-05-23 08:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422155, 952163, 67258, '<td valign="top">Positives - well photographed, lovely light, good depth of field, with the poppy, and particularly the bud standing out well.  <br/>Negatives - for me, at least, cerise and red are not a good combination, with the cerise geranium adding a rather garish feel.  I also find my eye following the ''gaze of the poppy'' and drawn out of the photo.</td>', 'Positives - well photographed, lovely light, good depth of field, with the poppy, and particularly the bud standing out well.  Negatives - for me, at least, cerise and red are not a good combination, with the cerise geranium adding a rather garish feel.  I also find my eye following the ''gaze of the poppy'' and drawn out of the photo.', '2011-05-23 08:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422156, 952171, 67258, '<td valign="top">A lovely composition, well composed, with colours that are reflected in the dog rose in my garden.  The damage to th leaf (lower right) is unfortunate, and now I have spotted the perfect ''hole punch'' circles, my eyes are drawn back to them - it might have been worth snipping them off before taking the photo.</td>', 'A lovely composition, well composed, with colours that are reflected in the dog rose in my garden.  The damage to th leaf (lower right) is unfortunate, and now I have spotted the perfect ''hole punch'' circles, my eyes are drawn back to them - it might have been worth snipping them off before taking the photo.', '2011-05-23 08:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422163, 952130, 67258, '<td valign="top">Pleasing composition, colours and bokeh - I particularly like the way the focus falls off to show softly focussed flowers echoing the main subject, all the way through to an impressionistic swathe of coloured bokeh. Personally not very keen on the green border, but no deductions for it.</td>', 'Pleasing composition, colours and bokeh - I particularly like the way the focus falls off to show softly focussed flowers echoing the main subject, all the way through to an impressionistic swathe of coloured bokeh. Personally not very keen on the green border, but no deductions for it.', '2011-05-23 08:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
