(6422685, 951754, 98339, '<td valign="top">this is totally technical and in the eye of the beholder (ME)...but it seems that you could have cropped this a little differently to really reduce the amount of "dead" space you have in the picture (mostly on the left side) it really does not add to the photo...and it would have kept the flower in the rule of thirds...mind you this is JMO....</td>', 'this is totally technical and in the eye of the beholder (ME)...but it seems that you could have cropped this a little differently to really reduce the amount of "dead" space you have in the picture (mostly on the left side) it really does not add to the photo...and it would have kept the flower in the rule of thirds...mind you this is JMO....', '2011-05-23 16:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422688, 952099, 120058, '<td valign="top">I like the angle you decided to take this photo from, makes the whole thing a bit more interesting for what in reality is a rather boring flower. The colour of the flowers seems to be a bit off though, more greenish than yellow, but it might just be the shadows and the contrast against the sky, or my eyes being wrong. I don''t know. 7</td>', 'I like the angle you decided to take this photo from, makes the whole thing a bit more interesting for what in reality is a rather boring flower. The colour of the flowers seems to be a bit off though, more greenish than yellow, but it might just be the shadows and the contrast against the sky, or my eyes being wrong. I don''t know. 7', '2011-05-23 16:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422691, 951026, 120058, '<td valign="top">I don''t even know what this is, but I''ve decided that it is a half eaten cone, and that is a flower, kind of. I like the photo, and how you''ve captured the colours - really nice! 8</td>', 'I don''t even know what this is, but I''ve decided that it is a half eaten cone, and that is a flower, kind of. I like the photo, and how you''ve captured the colours - really nice! 8', '2011-05-23 16:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422692, 951426, 120058, '<td valign="top">I like this picture, but in my opinion it would have been better if it wasn''t so yellowish, the white balance seems to wrong. 7</td>', 'I like this picture, but in my opinion it would have been better if it wasn''t so yellowish, the white balance seems to wrong. 7', '2011-05-23 16:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
