(6422696, 951471, 120058, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and it''s a really nice flower, but the focus seems to be a bit off and the colours a bit washed out and therefore some details are missing from the petals. 5</td>', 'I like the idea, and it''s a really nice flower, but the focus seems to be a bit off and the colours a bit washed out and therefore some details are missing from the petals. 5', '2011-05-23 16:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
