(6422842, 952092, 124256, '<td valign="top">To me this shot is too busy, lacks a focal point for the eye to rest on, appears too flat, and doesn''t have good enough lighting.  If this was my shot, I would have cropped far more aggressively and tweaked levels.  I think that would address most of what bothers me about the shot.</td>', 'To me this shot is too busy, lacks a focal point for the eye to rest on, appears too flat, and doesn''t have good enough lighting.  If this was my shot, I would have cropped far more aggressively and tweaked levels.  I think that would address most of what bothers me about the shot.', '2011-05-23 19:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422843, 952011, 124256, '<td valign="top">Nothing in this shot pops for me.  I can''t tell if anything is sharply in focus, but I feel like the shot needs it.  The people really detract from the shot in my opinion.  If they were gone, the building at the top might be pretty cool.  As it is, I would crop all of it out so the shot won''t be so busy.</td>', 'Nothing in this shot pops for me.  I can''t tell if anything is sharply in focus, but I feel like the shot needs it.  The people really detract from the shot in my opinion.  If they were gone, the building at the top might be pretty cool.  As it is, I would crop all of it out so the shot won''t be so busy.', '2011-05-23 19:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422845, 952111, 124256, '<td valign="top">Interesting an different.  I have trouble connecting with the shot though.</td>', 'Interesting an different.  I have trouble connecting with the shot though.', '2011-05-23 19:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
