(6422941, 951878, 120058, '<td valign="top">I''ve been looking at this shot several times now and I''m still trying to figure out what to write. It''s taken from an interesting angle, but there''s not much else to it. I''m not saying that it''s a bad picture, not at all, but there are a few things that could be better. <br/> <br/>My fist thought about it was that the sky seems to be a bit blown out, not a single detail and some bits of the flower are missing.<br/> <br/>I like the colour, and how you can see the veins in the leaves, makes it all a bit more interesting. <br/> <br/>A 5 from me!</td>', 'I''ve been looking at this shot several times now and I''m still trying to figure out what to write. It''s taken from an interesting angle, but there''s not much else to it. I''m not saying that it''s a bad picture, not at all, but there are a few things that could be better.  My fist thought about it was that the sky seems to be a bit blown out, not a single detail and some bits of the flower are missing. I like the colour, and how you can see the veins in the leaves, makes it all a bit more interesting.  A 5 from me!', '2011-05-23 20:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422944, 951906, 120058, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this photo I skipped it, I couldn''t decide what score to give it, or what not. Now I''m back, and I feel like I have to explain why I''m giving you a 5. <br/> <br/>Whereas the quality of this picture is good, it''s sharp and the colours are nice and I really like the composition, I''m not going to score this higher than 6. <br/> <br/>I am not saying that you have taken this photo in a studio, or that you haven''t, I''m saying that to me this just doesn''t feel natural. The light doesn''t seem to fall from a natural angle, the background isn''t really a background that just appears in the nature, but I also know that there are so many ways to get around this problem. <br/> <br/>For me, when I read "In garden and field", I don''t read "Must be garden or field visible in the picture", but I do take it as "use the natural light and what the nature brings you and make the best of it". I don''t see this in this picture, and therefore I will give this a 6.</td>', 'When I first saw this photo I skipped it, I couldn''t decide what score to give it, or what not. Now I''m back, and I feel like I have to explain why I''m giving you a 5.  Whereas the quality of this picture is good, it''s sharp and the colours are nice and I really like the composition, I''m not going to score this higher than 6.  I am not saying that you have taken this photo in a studio, or that you haven''t, I''m saying that to me this just doesn''t feel natural. The light doesn''t seem to fall from a natural angle, the background isn''t really a background that just appears in the nature, but I also know that there are so many ways to get around this problem.  For me, when I read "In garden and field", I don''t read "Must be garden or field visible in the picture", but I do take it as "use the natural light and what the nature brings you and make the best of it". I don''t see this in this picture, and therefore I will give this a 6.', '2011-05-23 21:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422945, 951962, 120058, '<td valign="top">I feel sorry for the sunflower, he seems so sad :(<br/> <br/>It''s a nice picture, but it is a bit out of focus. I do get the feeling that a mobile phone has been used. 5</td>', 'I feel sorry for the sunflower, he seems so sad :( It''s a nice picture, but it is a bit out of focus. I do get the feeling that a mobile phone has been used. 5', '2011-05-23 21:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422947, 951800, 120058, '<td valign="top">Lots and lots of flowers and colours! Good job, I would like to see a bit more room above the tractor though. 7</td>', 'Lots and lots of flowers and colours! Good job, I would like to see a bit more room above the tractor though. 7', '2011-05-23 21:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422948, 951922, 120058, '<td valign="top">Really nice colours! 7</td>', 'Really nice colours! 7', '2011-05-23 21:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422949, 952127, 120058, '<td valign="top">Really nice, and I like the title! 9</td>', 'Really nice, and I like the title! 9', '2011-05-23 21:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422950, 952097, 120058, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours, and the tree is really interesting. 6</td>', 'Beautiful colours, and the tree is really interesting. 6', '2011-05-23 21:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422951, 951848, 120058, '<td valign="top">This picture feels a lot like a snapshot, and doesn''t really do it for me. I would like to see a bit more of the parts above the lake, seems so much prettier. 5</td>', 'This picture feels a lot like a snapshot, and doesn''t really do it for me. I would like to see a bit more of the parts above the lake, seems so much prettier. 5', '2011-05-23 21:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422952, 951840, 120058, '<td valign="top">A lovely picture! 8</td>', 'A lovely picture! 8', '2011-05-23 21:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422954, 952082, 120058, '<td valign="top">This is such a hard picture to score. Part of me screams DNMC, but part of me tries to reason and say that it is actually outside, but the flowers aren''t growing. And the criteria did just say that the studio was off limits, not that you had to take a picture of a growing flower. <br/> <br/>Part of me also wants to give this photo a 4, part of me a 6 - Therefore you will get a 5. Seems easier that way. Might change my mind after a second look.</td>', 'This is such a hard picture to score. Part of me screams DNMC, but part of me tries to reason and say that it is actually outside, but the flowers aren''t growing. And the criteria did just say that the studio was off limits, not that you had to take a picture of a growing flower.  Part of me also wants to give this photo a 4, part of me a 6 - Therefore you will get a 5. Seems easier that way. Might change my mind after a second look.', '2011-05-23 21:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422955, 951910, 120058, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Like the colours and how you can se a bit of green in the background. 7</td>', 'Interesting. Like the colours and how you can se a bit of green in the background. 7', '2011-05-23 21:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422958, 951924, 120058, '<td valign="top">This challenge thought me the name of this flower. Being Swedish, I''ve never known it by the name Buttercup, but Smörblomma (translates to Butterflower, btw). So enough stories, and down to the dirty business: <br/> <br/>I like this and I must say that the tone of the green is amazing, but I''d much rather have just one flower in focus, the second one in the left hand corner is a bit distracting, hence my score which is a *drumroll* 7!!! (I do apologise, it''s 01:12 in the UK right now.</td>', 'This challenge thought me the name of this flower. Being Swedish, I''ve never known it by the name Buttercup, but Smörblomma (translates to Butterflower, btw). So enough stories, and down to the dirty business:  I like this and I must say that the tone of the green is amazing, but I''d much rather have just one flower in focus, the second one in the left hand corner is a bit distracting, hence my score which is a *drumroll* 7!!! (I do apologise, it''s 01:12 in the UK right now.', '2011-05-23 21:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422962, 952114, 120058, '<td valign="top">Whoohooo, I just realised why this flower is called what it is in Swedish. It''s Förgätmigej, which with a couple of spaces in between is Förgät mig ej -&gt; Forgot me not. Haha, I''ve never thought of that. <br/> <br/>So, nice picture, the right one looks like porcelain to me. Would like to see a bit more space on top of it though, really tight there. 6</td>', 'Whoohooo, I just realised why this flower is called what it is in Swedish. It''s Förgätmigej, which with a couple of spaces in between is Förgät mig ej -> Forgot me not. Haha, I''ve never thought of that.  So, nice picture, the right one looks like porcelain to me. Would like to see a bit more space on top of it though, really tight there. 6', '2011-05-23 21:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422964, 951275, 120058, '<td valign="top">I like this, but there''s a bit of a halo above the mountains which is a bit distracting. But don''t cry, you will still get an 8 from me!</td>', 'I like this, but there''s a bit of a halo above the mountains which is a bit distracting. But don''t cry, you will still get an 8 from me!', '2011-05-23 21:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
