(6422974, 951943, 120058, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful, but it''s a shame that bits of the flower got cropped out.. 8</td>', 'Really beautiful, but it''s a shame that bits of the flower got cropped out.. 8', '2011-05-23 21:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422975, 951571, 120058, '<td valign="top">The title bothers me, since La Vie En Rose translates to Life in Pink, and this flower is red. But, then my French isn''t the best, so I should probably just shut up, haha. <br/> <br/>It''s a lovely picture, but to me the flowers look way to over exposed, hardly no details at all in them. 5</td>', 'The title bothers me, since La Vie En Rose translates to Life in Pink, and this flower is red. But, then my French isn''t the best, so I should probably just shut up, haha.  It''s a lovely picture, but to me the flowers look way to over exposed, hardly no details at all in them. 5', '2011-05-23 21:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422976, 952078, 120058, '<td valign="top">Really nice colours and composition. Like how you took the picture from behind, makes it all a bit more interesting. 7</td>', 'Really nice colours and composition. Like how you took the picture from behind, makes it all a bit more interesting. 7', '2011-05-23 21:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422980, 951465, 119419, '<td valign="top">A delicious effort, I love the lines of ordered confusion and their softness. The budding flower stands out wonderfully 8</td>', 'A delicious effort, I love the lines of ordered confusion and their softness. The budding flower stands out wonderfully 8', '2011-05-23 21:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422981, 952147, 119419, '<td valign="top">Love this one, looks as though it''s underwater, probably one of those new fangled lens baby things ;) The lighting is right, tones are good, composition classic. 7</td>', 'Love this one, looks as though it''s underwater, probably one of those new fangled lens baby things ;) The lighting is right, tones are good, composition classic. 7', '2011-05-23 21:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422982, 951886, 119419, '<td valign="top">Seems to me you''ve used a filter on the top half, clever if you did. It pushes the foreground nicely although the light drops off right up front a bit. Nice tone throughout with wonderful colour. 7</td>', 'Seems to me you''ve used a filter on the top half, clever if you did. It pushes the foreground nicely although the light drops off right up front a bit. Nice tone throughout with wonderful colour. 7', '2011-05-23 21:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422983, 951747, 119419, '<td valign="top">A beautiful light and classic subject shapes, the right flower maybe a little flat needs a dodge to bring out the top layer of petals. But a lovely shot 7</td>', 'A beautiful light and classic subject shapes, the right flower maybe a little flat needs a dodge to bring out the top layer of petals. But a lovely shot 7', '2011-05-23 21:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422984, 952162, 119419, '<td valign="top">The rain streaks are wonderful, I wish the flower itself was more prominent, it''s a little blown out for me as the main subject. Good shot just the same 7</td>', 'The rain streaks are wonderful, I wish the flower itself was more prominent, it''s a little blown out for me as the main subject. Good shot just the same 7', '2011-05-23 21:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
