(6422988, 951463, 119419, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful macro, nice composition</td>', 'Very beautiful macro, nice composition', '2011-05-23 21:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422991, 951977, 119419, '<td valign="top">Great macro, good focus on the watery edges, though it doesn''t give the complete impression of in the garden or field, but I believe you and like it.</td>', 'Great macro, good focus on the watery edges, though it doesn''t give the complete impression of in the garden or field, but I believe you and like it.', '2011-05-23 21:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422994, 951877, 119419, '<td valign="top">The road gives a great contrast to the broad meadow scene, I like how the white flowers take a while to emerge.</td>', 'The road gives a great contrast to the broad meadow scene, I like how the white flowers take a while to emerge.', '2011-05-23 21:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422996, 951723, 119419, '<td valign="top">wonderful, clear and humourous.</td>', 'wonderful, clear and humourous.', '2011-05-23 21:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422999, 951278, 119419, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous and soft, I like it. The ones up the front are a little distracting because of their size, I suppose a higher angle could be tried, but wonderful.</td>', 'Gorgeous and soft, I like it. The ones up the front are a little distracting because of their size, I suppose a higher angle could be tried, but wonderful.', '2011-05-23 21:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423001, 952119, 119419, '<td valign="top">Crispy and clean, gives me that early morning feel.</td>', 'Crispy and clean, gives me that early morning feel.', '2011-05-23 21:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423002, 952065, 119419, '<td valign="top">Nice and velvety, I would have cropped out the right hand leaf but that''s me,  good work.</td>', 'Nice and velvety, I would have cropped out the right hand leaf but that''s me,  good work.', '2011-05-23 21:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423004, 951180, 119419, '<td valign="top">It''s the lower half background that really does it for me here, the flower provides a good colour contrast but maybe it''s too much right in the middle. Good job, I like it.</td>', 'It''s the lower half background that really does it for me here, the flower provides a good colour contrast but maybe it''s too much right in the middle. Good job, I like it.', '2011-05-23 21:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423006, 951784, 119419, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, she looks a little awkward with the knees up, maybe a lotus position ;) would do. Very pretty.</td>', 'Lovely shot, she looks a little awkward with the knees up, maybe a lotus position ;) would do. Very pretty.', '2011-05-23 21:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423067, 951064, 100831, '<td valign="top">I just find this mesmerizing. Engaging. Beautifully presented.</td>', 'I just find this mesmerizing. Engaging. Beautifully presented.', '2011-05-23 23:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423093, 952069, 124256, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I really like the color contrast.  I think with a deeper dof getting the entire subject sharply in focus would have made this an awesome shot.</td>', 'Nice.  I really like the color contrast.  I think with a deeper dof getting the entire subject sharply in focus would have made this an awesome shot.', '2011-05-24 00:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423095, 952163, 124256, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  I just wish the red flower was more sharply in focus.</td>', 'I like this shot.  I just wish the red flower was more sharply in focus.', '2011-05-24 00:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423097, 951588, 124256, '<td valign="top">Great subject and colors!  I wish the portion in focus popped more -- or that the dof was deeper.</td>', 'Great subject and colors!  I wish the portion in focus popped more -- or that the dof was deeper.', '2011-05-24 00:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423100, 952107, 124256, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I love the color and texture.  I like how the in focus subject appears to be floating, hovering.</td>', 'Nice.  I love the color and texture.  I like how the in focus subject appears to be floating, hovering.', '2011-05-24 00:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423101, 952013, 124256, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed shot.</td>', 'Nicely composed shot.', '2011-05-24 00:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423102, 952078, 124256, '<td valign="top">I love looking in through the back with the light coming in from the front.  Pretty!</td>', 'I love looking in through the back with the light coming in from the front.  Pretty!', '2011-05-24 00:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423103, 951820, 124256, '<td valign="top">Since you went with the really tight crop, I would have cropped more off the bottom.  That said, great subject and shot!</td>', 'Since you went with the really tight crop, I would have cropped more off the bottom.  That said, great subject and shot!', '2011-05-24 00:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423104, 951107, 124256, '<td valign="top">I love your subject!  I think this would have really popped with a deeper dof, or with the focus range pushed just a little bit further away.  The oof center of the flower detracts for me.</td>', 'I love your subject!  I think this would have really popped with a deeper dof, or with the focus range pushed just a little bit further away.  The oof center of the flower detracts for me.', '2011-05-24 00:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423105, 952151, 124256, '<td valign="top">Nice!  My eye keeps looking for a brighter highlight that you might have gotten by cranking up the contrast.  As it is, my eye can''t find a focal point to rest on on this otherwise great shot.</td>', 'Nice!  My eye keeps looking for a brighter highlight that you might have gotten by cranking up the contrast.  As it is, my eye can''t find a focal point to rest on on this otherwise great shot.', '2011-05-24 00:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423106, 952045, 124256, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I liked it significantly better on a second look.  The leaves shooting up oof are great, and the color of your subject pops.  I would have maybe tried running it through a sharpening filter.</td>', 'Great shot.  I liked it significantly better on a second look.  The leaves shooting up oof are great, and the color of your subject pops.  I would have maybe tried running it through a sharpening filter.', '2011-05-24 00:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423119, 951935, 124256, '<td valign="top">Somehow the shot doesn''t seems to pop for me.  Maybe if the tulip occupied a larger proportion of the frame I would like the balance better.  Also, it seems like the bluebells are between a balance of "a sea of flowers" and "a manageable few in the shot" and to me end up making the shot just seem too busy.</td>', 'Somehow the shot doesn''t seems to pop for me.  Maybe if the tulip occupied a larger proportion of the frame I would like the balance better.  Also, it seems like the bluebells are between a balance of "a sea of flowers" and "a manageable few in the shot" and to me end up making the shot just seem too busy.', '2011-05-24 00:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423123, 952079, 124256, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  I really wish there was more direct light on the pink petals.  I love the lighting on the second one from the left, though mainly just the white petals, and to a lesser extent the lower half.</td>', 'Cool shot.  I really wish there was more direct light on the pink petals.  I love the lighting on the second one from the left, though mainly just the white petals, and to a lesser extent the lower half.', '2011-05-24 00:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423124, 951747, 124256, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot much better when I came back to it.  The muted colors, tone, and palette really work for me, especially with the great focus.  Well done!</td>', 'I liked this shot much better when I came back to it.  The muted colors, tone, and palette really work for me, especially with the great focus.  Well done!', '2011-05-24 00:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423134, 951958, 124256, '<td valign="top">The shot doesn''t look quite right to me.  I think the contrast between the buds in shadow and the pink petals is too jarring.  I feel like the pink flower behind the shadowed buds should be the focal point, but that it is blocked and interrupted.</td>', 'The shot doesn''t look quite right to me.  I think the contrast between the buds in shadow and the pink petals is too jarring.  I feel like the pink flower behind the shadowed buds should be the focal point, but that it is blocked and interrupted.', '2011-05-24 00:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423135, 951692, 124256, '<td valign="top">This shot seems washed out and flat to me.  I''m not sure where the focal point is, and nothing seems sharply in focus.  Perhaps from a higher vantage point the overall design of the landscaping would have been enough to carry the shot.</td>', 'This shot seems washed out and flat to me.  I''m not sure where the focal point is, and nothing seems sharply in focus.  Perhaps from a higher vantage point the overall design of the landscaping would have been enough to carry the shot.', '2011-05-24 00:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423136, 951945, 124256, '<td valign="top">It seems like the dirt or stone on the left edge of the shot is in focus instead of the flowers.  As it is they don''t pop and the shot doesn''t look quite right to me.</td>', 'It seems like the dirt or stone on the left edge of the shot is in focus instead of the flowers.  As it is they don''t pop and the shot doesn''t look quite right to me.', '2011-05-24 00:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423137, 951800, 124256, '<td valign="top">Your cropping doesn''t work for me.  It seems like you have chopped off some of what I need to see at the top -- or more obviously you should have cropped all of that clutter right out.  Also, I wish the flowers were in focus.</td>', 'Your cropping doesn''t work for me.  It seems like you have chopped off some of what I need to see at the top -- or more obviously you should have cropped all of that clutter right out.  Also, I wish the flowers were in focus.', '2011-05-24 00:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423138, 951962, 124256, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  Unfortunately your shot is tragically out of focus, killing it for me.</td>', 'Great idea!  Unfortunately your shot is tragically out of focus, killing it for me.', '2011-05-24 00:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423139, 951891, 124256, '<td valign="top">Fascinating shot.  The flowers seem to be too much of an afterthought to meet the challenge.</td>', 'Fascinating shot.  The flowers seem to be too much of an afterthought to meet the challenge.', '2011-05-24 00:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423140, 951137, 124256, '<td valign="top">I like your composition and the bokeh is really nice.  Unfortunately, based on your title and the way I see your photo, the bug is the focal point and is tragically oof.  In fact, the only flower parts in focus don''t look that great to me.  I think a deeper dof would have really helped out this shot a lot.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like your composition and the bokeh is really nice.  Unfortunately, based on your title and the way I see your photo, the bug is the focal point and is tragically oof.  In fact, the only flower parts in focus don''t look that great to me.  I think a deeper dof would have really helped out this shot a lot.  Good luck!', '2011-05-24 00:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423141, 951570, 124256, '<td valign="top">Ah, I think this could have been nice if it was in focus.</td>', 'Ah, I think this could have been nice if it was in focus.', '2011-05-24 00:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423143, 951064, 124256, '<td valign="top">I like the look of your shot, but can''t relate it to the challenge at all.</td>', 'I like the look of your shot, but can''t relate it to the challenge at all.', '2011-05-24 00:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423145, 951850, 124256, '<td valign="top">The shot comes off looking very flat in an unappealing way to me.  Also, the stem on the right is too dominant, taking focus away from the bloom.  Speaking of focus, the shot seems oof to me, it certainly doesn''t pop.</td>', 'The shot comes off looking very flat in an unappealing way to me.  Also, the stem on the right is too dominant, taking focus away from the bloom.  Speaking of focus, the shot seems oof to me, it certainly doesn''t pop.', '2011-05-24 00:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423146, 952112, 124256, '<td valign="top">Ah, I wish your shot was better in focus.</td>', 'Ah, I wish your shot was better in focus.', '2011-05-24 00:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423147, 951180, 124256, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and title here a lot.  Unfortunately the shot is too flat, dark, and out of focus.  If you got the flower to pop somehow I think this would have been a really good one.</td>', 'I like the idea and title here a lot.  Unfortunately the shot is too flat, dark, and out of focus.  If you got the flower to pop somehow I think this would have been a really good one.', '2011-05-24 00:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423148, 951848, 124256, '<td valign="top">I wish you cropped a little bit more at the top, the structure(s) up there is very distracting.  Also, I love cattails, but I can''t make out any of the flowering spikes in your shot.  Sharper focus would help as well.</td>', 'I wish you cropped a little bit more at the top, the structure(s) up there is very distracting.  Also, I love cattails, but I can''t make out any of the flowering spikes in your shot.  Sharper focus would help as well.', '2011-05-24 00:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423149, 951877, 124256, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if anything is in focus, but it doesn''t seem like it to me.  Also, I don''t understand why you included the road and across the street in shadow at the top.  The white dashes painted on the road are the most dominant feature in the photo to my eye.</td>', 'I can''t tell if anything is in focus, but it doesn''t seem like it to me.  Also, I don''t understand why you included the road and across the street in shadow at the top.  The white dashes painted on the road are the most dominant feature in the photo to my eye.', '2011-05-24 00:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423150, 951398, 124256, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh.  Unfortunately your subject is oof and I can''t get past that as your shot seems to really call for an in focus subject.</td>', 'Nice bokeh.  Unfortunately your subject is oof and I can''t get past that as your shot seems to really call for an in focus subject.', '2011-05-24 00:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423151, 951268, 124256, '<td valign="top">Cropping doesn''t work for me on this one.  I feel like I need to see just a little more a the bottom, and probably on the right as well.  Also, nothing appears to be in focus, and I find it difficult to get past that.</td>', 'Cropping doesn''t work for me on this one.  I feel like I need to see just a little more a the bottom, and probably on the right as well.  Also, nothing appears to be in focus, and I find it difficult to get past that.', '2011-05-24 00:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423170, 951234, 64068, '<td valign="top">I love it, despite the noise in the BG or maybe just a harsh bokeh, not sure.. 10</td>', 'I love it, despite the noise in the BG or maybe just a harsh bokeh, not sure.. 10', '2011-05-24 01:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
