(6423326, 952148, 63218, '<td valign="top">Nice job picking a pale flower against a shadow BG &amp; nailing the exposure. The light is just right for this.</td>', 'Nice job picking a pale flower against a shadow BG & nailing the exposure. The light is just right for this.', '2011-05-24 11:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
