(6423360, 952065, 118154, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.</td>', 'Nice and simple.', '2011-05-24 12:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423361, 951391, 118154, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the focus,for me not 100% where it should be.Nice composition.</td>', 'Not sure about the focus,for me not 100% where it should be.Nice composition.', '2011-05-24 13:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423368, 951427, 54645, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene, I like the complexity of the dense field</td>', 'Beautiful scene, I like the complexity of the dense field', '2011-05-24 13:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423415, 951383, 100831, '<td valign="top">I love the swoopy line. I think there''s a little story going on here... and it has a happy ending.</td>', 'I love the swoopy line. I think there''s a little story going on here... and it has a happy ending.', '2011-05-24 13:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423420, 951150, 123094, '<td valign="top">By any other name...not a fan of harsh lighting on delicate subjects; and the background is so stark, but not enough make it a statement of contrast.</td>', 'By any other name...not a fan of harsh lighting on delicate subjects; and the background is so stark, but not enough make it a statement of contrast.', '2011-05-24 14:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423424, 952047, 123094, '<td valign="top">Quite outstanding! Not the most beautiful subject by any means, but I''m finding beauty in the details. Nice job.</td>', 'Quite outstanding! Not the most beautiful subject by any means, but I''m finding beauty in the details. Nice job.', '2011-05-24 14:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423426, 951426, 123094, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Love the crispness of the lower peddle lines. Not liking the lighting, but it''s starting to grow on me. Giving a 6 for now, but may be back to bump it up.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Love the crispness of the lower peddle lines. Not liking the lighting, but it''s starting to grow on me. Giving a 6 for now, but may be back to bump it up.', '2011-05-24 14:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423431, 952031, 123094, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...well lit, well composed, well done.</td>', 'Beautiful...well lit, well composed, well done.', '2011-05-24 14:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423438, 951747, 123094, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I was going to rate this a little below average because it seemed a bit darker than necessary to me, but the title made me think twice about the mood of the image. Solemn, reverent; I think a brighter image would have ruined that feel. I hope that was what you were going for because I''m giving you a high rating now.</td>', 'Interesting. I was going to rate this a little below average because it seemed a bit darker than necessary to me, but the title made me think twice about the mood of the image. Solemn, reverent; I think a brighter image would have ruined that feel. I hope that was what you were going for because I''m giving you a high rating now.', '2011-05-24 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423440, 952013, 123094, '<td valign="top">Wow! You need to warn people to put their sunglasses on before you spring something like this on them! Would it be trite to call this one "brilliant"?</td>', 'Wow! You need to warn people to put their sunglasses on before you spring something like this on them! Would it be trite to call this one "brilliant"?', '2011-05-24 14:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423442, 951180, 123094, '<td valign="top">What a scary, scary image. This could have just as easily been entitled "Despair" as not even the colors in the flower make up for the gloom surrounding it. Very emotional shot. I like it.</td>', 'What a scary, scary image. This could have just as easily been entitled "Despair" as not even the colors in the flower make up for the gloom surrounding it. Very emotional shot. I like it.', '2011-05-24 14:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423444, 951971, 123094, '<td valign="top">Always such a fine line between being too contrasty and too flat with flowers. Beautiful flower, but looks like it falls into that flat category.</td>', 'Always such a fine line between being too contrasty and too flat with flowers. Beautiful flower, but looks like it falls into that flat category.', '2011-05-24 14:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423448, 952026, 123094, '<td valign="top">Holding back the tears ''cause nothing here has grown. Like the contrast, even though I''m not at all a fan of harsh lighting on such subjects.</td>', 'Holding back the tears ''cause nothing here has grown. Like the contrast, even though I''m not at all a fan of harsh lighting on such subjects.', '2011-05-24 14:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423449, 952041, 123094, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and DOF, but would have liked it more with whiter whites...and fewer bugs, but they''re growing on me.</td>', 'Lovely composition and DOF, but would have liked it more with whiter whites...and fewer bugs, but they''re growing on me.', '2011-05-24 14:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423451, 951506, 123094, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh and subjects. A tad soft in the focus though. And believe it or not, that spider web is driving me nuts.</td>', 'Nice bokeh and subjects. A tad soft in the focus though. And believe it or not, that spider web is driving me nuts.', '2011-05-24 14:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423455, 951954, 114225, '<td valign="top">Make sure you watch out for blown out reds in a photo like this. To my eyes, the red saturation looks very heavy and distracting.</td>', 'Make sure you watch out for blown out reds in a photo like this. To my eyes, the red saturation looks very heavy and distracting.', '2011-05-24 15:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423456, 951478, 123094, '<td valign="top">Straight out of a botanical textbook. Not sure what''s going on with the out of focus edges ~ same thing happened to mine after post processing. Otherwise looks good and you''ve captured the 3rd dimension.</td>', 'Straight out of a botanical textbook. Not sure what''s going on with the out of focus edges ~ same thing happened to mine after post processing. Otherwise looks good and you''ve captured the 3rd dimension.', '2011-05-24 15:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423457, 951478, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what''s causing it, but I''m seeing some distracting artifacts around the edges.</td>', 'I''m not sure what''s causing it, but I''m seeing some distracting artifacts around the edges.', '2011-05-24 15:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423458, 952079, 63218, '<td valign="top">I see little birds with white wings</td>', 'I see little birds with white wings', '2011-05-24 15:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423459, 952163, 16106, '<td valign="top">Lovely variety of forms but so much of the composition seems to be squeezed to the edge of the frame.</td>', 'Lovely variety of forms but so much of the composition seems to be squeezed to the edge of the frame.', '2011-05-24 15:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423461, 951180, 16106, '<td valign="top">the quiet colors may cost you some votes, but it works so well with the wild tangle of forms here. Well seen.</td>', 'the quiet colors may cost you some votes, but it works so well with the wild tangle of forms here. Well seen.', '2011-05-24 15:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423466, 952130, 12611, '<td valign="top">great color array; very nice.</td>', 'great color array; very nice.', '2011-05-24 15:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423467, 951954, 16106, '<td valign="top">A great capture, but the bee is so well presented that it becomes the subject and the flower becomes background rather than the subject.</td>', 'A great capture, but the bee is so well presented that it becomes the subject and the flower becomes background rather than the subject.', '2011-05-24 15:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423468, 952139, 12611, '<td valign="top">so much like a lazy Renoir or Pissarro; the only thing to improve on this shot would be golden burned out grasses as a backdrop- but it needs no improving; great job!</td>', 'so much like a lazy Renoir or Pissarro; the only thing to improve on this shot would be golden burned out grasses as a backdrop- but it needs no improving; great job!', '2011-05-24 15:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423482, 951733, 131598, '<td valign="top">Love this photo!</td>', 'Love this photo!', '2011-05-24 15:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423488, 951882, 123094, '<td valign="top">I would have liked a tighter crop.</td>', 'I would have liked a tighter crop.', '2011-05-24 16:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423496, 951840, 109227, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites; nice perspective.  Voting earlier, bumping up.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites; nice perspective.  Voting earlier, bumping up.', '2011-05-24 16:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423497, 951272, 109227, '<td valign="top">Looks like a windy day; it really adds to the image.</td>', 'Looks like a windy day; it really adds to the image.', '2011-05-24 16:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423510, 951064, 63218, '<td valign="top">This looks like one of my umbrella shots. I think I see fabric.</td>', 'This looks like one of my umbrella shots. I think I see fabric.', '2011-05-24 16:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423514, 952159, 129894, '<td valign="top">Should of been in colour.</td>', 'Should of been in colour.', '2011-05-24 16:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423526, 952082, 63218, '<td valign="top">an outdoor wedding?</td>', 'an outdoor wedding?', '2011-05-24 16:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423534, 952095, 86090, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail and colors, not crazy about the border though. I think an image this good stands out by itself.</td>', 'Very nice detail and colors, not crazy about the border though. I think an image this good stands out by itself.', '2011-05-24 16:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423550, 952111, 125552, '<td valign="top">Would have been better if it wasn''t blurry... but I like the idea :)</td>', 'Would have been better if it wasn''t blurry... but I like the idea :)', '2011-05-24 17:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423552, 951508, 125552, '<td valign="top"><b>LOVE</b> this picture :) the spider makes it come together.</td>', 'LOVE this picture :) the spider makes it come together.', '2011-05-24 17:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423554, 951550, 125552, '<td valign="top">It appeared as you hued this photo... I like the idea, but I don''t believe it goes by the basic editing guidelines :/</td>', 'It appeared as you hued this photo... I like the idea, but I don''t believe it goes by the basic editing guidelines :/', '2011-05-24 17:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423556, 951923, 125552, '<td valign="top">Love the saturation in this photo! Great job getting the three bright colors in one outstanding photo :)</td>', 'Love the saturation in this photo! Great job getting the three bright colors in one outstanding photo :)', '2011-05-24 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423558, 951611, 125552, '<td valign="top">I am in love with this photo!! It''s my favorite flower also :) 10 from me!</td>', 'I am in love with this photo!! It''s my favorite flower also :) 10 from me!', '2011-05-24 17:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423560, 951478, 125552, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!!! 9</td>', 'Beautiful!!!! 9', '2011-05-24 17:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
