(6423775, 952158, 104230, '<td valign="top">A lovely image somewhat spoiled in my eyes by what appears to be an unnatural pattern of moisture as if the petals have recently been misted.  A challenge that is about capturing flowers in a meadow or garden to me means capturing them in their natural form, so you loose a couple of points on that basis.<br/> <br/>ETA:  I was at Point Reyes, CA today as the persistent fog lifted (only briefly). I now know that one can photograph a plant covered with a layer of fine drops of moisture under those circumstances. Regret I did not know this when I made my comment earlier<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-06-06 20:51:01.</i></td>', 'A lovely image somewhat spoiled in my eyes by what appears to be an unnatural pattern of moisture as if the petals have recently been misted.  A challenge that is about capturing flowers in a meadow or garden to me means capturing them in their natural form, so you loose a couple of points on that basis. ETA:  I was at Point Reyes, CA today as the persistent fog lifted (only briefly). I now know that one can photograph a plant covered with a layer of fine drops of moisture under those circumstances. Regret I did not know this when I made my comment earlier', '2011-05-24 23:05:10.000000', '2011-06-06 21:51:01.000000', 1),
