(6425307, 951655, 130157, '<td valign="top">I like this photo very much.  It stayed with me as the best photo of the group. Well done.</td>', 'I like this photo very much.  It stayed with me as the best photo of the group. Well done.', '2011-05-26 18:48:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(6425845, 952111, 127021, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the helpful comments i wish i"d gotten a better take of this... I was honestly afraid of damaging my camera... Anyway - and that''s some cold shit <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=107506" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Beefncheez</a> especially for a newbie like me... But I appreciate the comments all the same.</td>', 'Thanks for the helpful comments i wish i"d gotten a better take of this... I was honestly afraid of damaging my camera... Anyway - and that''s some cold shit  Beefncheez especially for a newbie like me... But I appreciate the comments all the same.', '2011-05-27 05:11:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6425942, 951877, 100831, '<td valign="top">Without the street this would have been a hodgepodge, with it it''s a beauty. I was one of your high scores. Kudos!</td>', 'Without the street this would have been a hodgepodge, with it it''s a beauty. I was one of your high scores. Kudos!', '2011-05-27 09:46:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6425956, 951559, 39184, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon.  I look through the top 20 to 40 images from every single challenge and I was curious about something with your entry...Did anybody mention the tilted horizon?  Unbelievably, no!  I couldn''t pass on offering a constructive comment on something that, on one hand, I think is extremely important, but on the other hand, nobody mentioned.  So, how important could it be?  I still think that it is important and maybe you got away with it because the best reference to judge the horizon, the waterline, was obscured so much.  Then again, maybe you got away with it because it is a beautiful picture with a great composition.  You certainly deserve points for the low perspective and the composition with the group of flowers bottom right leading your eye to the mountain peak top left.  Overall great job, but I felt it would be wrong if the tilted horizon was not mentioned as something that could be improved upon.</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon.  I look through the top 20 to 40 images from every single challenge and I was curious about something with your entry...Did anybody mention the tilted horizon?  Unbelievably, no!  I couldn''t pass on offering a constructive comment on something that, on one hand, I think is extremely important, but on the other hand, nobody mentioned.  So, how important could it be?  I still think that it is important and maybe you got away with it because the best reference to judge the horizon, the waterline, was obscured so much.  Then again, maybe you got away with it because it is a beautiful picture with a great composition.  You certainly deserve points for the low perspective and the composition with the group of flowers bottom right leading your eye to the mountain peak top left.  Overall great job, but I felt it would be wrong if the tilted horizon was not mentioned as something that could be improved upon.', '2011-05-27 09:57:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6426026, 952151, 93756, '<td valign="top">edited.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-06-09 21:14:20.</i></td>', 'edited.', '2011-05-27 11:50:25.000000', '2011-06-09 22:14:20.000000', 0),
