(6426410, 951886, 98022, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Congrats on the top 10!</td>', 'Beautiful image. Congrats on the top 10!', '2011-05-27 22:15:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6426411, 952089, 98022, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous macro! Focus is right on, and the DOF and bokeh is outstanding! Congrats on the top 10. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Gorgeous macro! Focus is right on, and the DOF and bokeh is outstanding! Congrats on the top 10. One of my favorites.', '2011-05-27 22:16:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6426413, 952033, 98022, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top 10! This was one of my top picks.</td>', 'Congrats on the top 10! This was one of my top picks.', '2011-05-27 22:17:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6426415, 952126, 98022, '<td valign="top">A most excellent macro Janine! Should have taken the blue IMHO. The detail in the bloom is outstanding, particularly since it is white. Congrats on the top 10!</td>', 'A most excellent macro Janine! Should have taken the blue IMHO. The detail in the bloom is outstanding, particularly since it is white. Congrats on the top 10!', '2011-05-27 22:21:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6426416, 952089, 133401, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2011-05-27 22:22:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6426538, 952028, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m bummin for you because you have a really good shot here and only a 5.5ish to show for it.  Watch out what you do with HSL or saturation because you''ll get that line line you see around that top flower.  Anywho, this is really good!</td>', 'I''m bummin for you because you have a really good shot here and only a 5.5ish to show for it.  Watch out what you do with HSL or saturation because you''ll get that line line you see around that top flower.  Anywho, this is really good!', '2011-05-28 00:29:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6426773, 951064, 67697, '<td valign="top">I see this more as a ghostly image rather than a floral image.  It''s like you''ve captured the spirit of nature.  Very cool.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-05-28 12:50:19.</i></td>', 'I see this more as a ghostly image rather than a floral image.  It''s like you''ve captured the spirit of nature.  Very cool.', '2011-05-28 13:49:55.000000', '2011-05-28 13:50:19.000000', 0),
(6426976, 952156, 81741, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the votes. I knew it wouldn''t be the best entry, but needed to get my feet wet. These are coastal Coastal Redwoods in the Santa Cruz mountains. It''s always pretty here so I sometimes forget to get out and shoot.</td>', 'Thanks for the votes. I knew it wouldn''t be the best entry, but needed to get my feet wet. These are coastal Coastal Redwoods in the Santa Cruz mountains. It''s always pretty here so I sometimes forget to get out and shoot.', '2011-05-28 23:06:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6427139, 952086, 117474, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. Very nicely framed. It doesn''t distract, so it''s not a problem, but if I was taking this shot I''d''ve probably used a wider aperture to bokeh-ify the ground more. Just a personal thing I guess. Lovely sharpness here!</td>', 'Very nice image. Very nicely framed. It doesn''t distract, so it''s not a problem, but if I was taking this shot I''d''ve probably used a wider aperture to bokeh-ify the ground more. Just a personal thing I guess. Lovely sharpness here!', '2011-05-29 10:49:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6427184, 951398, 132752, '<td valign="top">thanks for all your suggestions, :D<br/>i really appreciate it....i''ll try to improve on the focus and lighting next time.</td>', 'thanks for all your suggestions, :Di really appreciate it....i''ll try to improve on the focus and lighting next time.', '2011-05-29 11:53:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6427224, 951383, 62357, '<td valign="top">Not used to so much colour from you Brian!  Nice.</td>', 'Not used to so much colour from you Brian!  Nice.', '2011-05-29 13:03:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6427225, 952031, 100831, '<td valign="top">Beautiful deep, rich colors.</td>', 'Beautiful deep, rich colors.', '2011-05-29 13:03:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6427232, 951885, 30861, '<td valign="top">Congrats, sneezy! Been a while, nice to see ya back.</td>', 'Congrats, sneezy! Been a while, nice to see ya back.', '2011-05-29 13:12:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6427274, 952110, 117474, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones, and shapes, and textures in this. Not surprised about the score considering all the happy sunshine in garden images that scored well, but you beat me! :)</td>', 'Lovely tones, and shapes, and textures in this. Not surprised about the score considering all the happy sunshine in garden images that scored well, but you beat me! :)', '2011-05-29 14:14:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(6427309, 952110, 131284, '<td valign="top">Thanks Niall (and everyone else for your comments). I''m perfectly happy with this score for this image, I knew it wouldn''t score highly, I actually guessed it''d be around 4.8 at the start of the challenge. And I guess since you beat me by .1 in the last challenge it''s fair I beat you by .1 this time =).</td>', 'Thanks Niall (and everyone else for your comments). I''m perfectly happy with this score for this image, I knew it wouldn''t score highly, I actually guessed it''d be around 4.8 at the start of the challenge. And I guess since you beat me by .1 in the last challenge it''s fair I beat you by .1 this time =).', '2011-05-29 15:04:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6427315, 951308, 131284, '<td valign="top">So it looks like your image suffered from a similar problem to mine. As you said, ''happy sunshine in garden image'' appears to be the key to this challenge. Actually the first time I glanced at this I thought it was a fly sitting on someone''s leg in a plaster cast... maybe some others didn''t look a little closer before voting =). It''s a nice image though, the petal has a great texture to it and the dof is just right, much better than a number of the images that scored better.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-05-29 14:12:39.</i></td>', 'So it looks like your image suffered from a similar problem to mine. As you said, ''happy sunshine in garden image'' appears to be the key to this challenge. Actually the first time I glanced at this I thought it was a fly sitting on someone''s leg in a plaster cast... maybe some others didn''t look a little closer before voting =). It''s a nice image though, the petal has a great texture to it and the dof is just right, much better than a number of the images that scored better.', '2011-05-29 15:11:21.000000', '2011-05-29 15:12:39.000000', 0),
(6427330, 951840, 58634, '<td valign="top">This image is still a ribbon winner in my book.</td>', 'This image is still a ribbon winner in my book.', '2011-05-29 15:57:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6427357, 951885, 5112, '<td valign="top">Well, now, there you are!  Congratulations again, I like this picture.</td>', 'Well, now, there you are!  Congratulations again, I like this picture.', '2011-05-29 16:59:22.000000', NULL, 0),
