(6427597, 951885, 65319, '<td valign="top">Oh...I''m so glad I didn''t tease you about yet another 4th place as that didn''t last very long.  Did I mention how awesome that purple is?!!!  Well done, Jason!</td>', 'Oh...I''m so glad I didn''t tease you about yet another 4th place as that didn''t last very long.  Did I mention how awesome that purple is?!!!  Well done, Jason!', '2011-05-29 22:42:36.000000', NULL, 0),
