(6427967, 951885, 59267, '<td valign="top">Camas? Lily. Love the natural tone on this. Congratulations on your ribbon 39!! <br/>Looks like I should buy this powerful <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/lens.php?LENS_ID=50" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">lens</a>.</td>', 'Camas? Lily. Love the natural tone on this. Congratulations on your ribbon 39!! Looks like I should buy this powerful lens.', '2011-05-30 03:14:28.000000', NULL, 0),
