(6429756, 951885, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by william88:</b></div><hr/><i> Camas? Lily. Love the natural tone on this. Congratulations on your ribbon 39!! <br/>Looks like I should buy this powerful <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/lens.php?LENS_ID=50" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">lens</a>. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>If you''re chasing vanity get that lens but if you want something just as good but half the price get the Tamron SP AF 180mm f/3.5 Di LD IF. It''s a sweet lens with great optics and the build isn''t too shabby either.<br/> <br/>ETA: Congrats Jason. 4th would have been better though. :P<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-05-31 19:27:56.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by william88: Camas? Lily. Love the natural tone on this. Congratulations on your ribbon 39!! Looks like I should buy this powerful lens.   If you''re chasing vanity get that lens but if you want something just as good but half the price get the Tamron SP AF 180mm f/3.5 Di LD IF. It''s a sweet lens with great optics and the build isn''t too shabby either. ETA: Congrats Jason. 4th would have been better though. :P', '2011-05-31 20:24:05.000000', '2011-05-31 20:27:56.000000', 0),
